{"product_id":"caliburn-a3s-pods","title":"Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience enhanced vaping convenience with the Uwell Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods. Each pod boasts a 2mL refillable capacity, allowing you to enjoy your favorite eJuices without frequent refills. Crafted from durable PCTG material, these pods are built to last. The user-friendly side fill system makes refilling a breeze. These pods come with integrated 0.8ohm or 1.0ohm coils for exceptional flavor delivery. Thanks to the magnetic connection, swapping out these pods is quick and hassle-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill System\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Integrated Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.8 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775207972919,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.0 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775208005687,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 1.0 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-a3s-replacement-pod-min_e7e1acd5-cb3d-4e8a-917c-80889a5670ec.jpg?v=1752511754","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-a3s-pods","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




